        "story": "<p>DRIFT started with a simple frustration: great streetwear was either imported and overpriced, or local and made to fall apart after a few washes. We wanted pieces that felt premium, fit the way we like to wear them, and were made right here at home.</p><p>So we went back to basics: heavyweight cotton, boxy cuts, clean graphics and details you notice the longer you own them. Every piece is developed and produced in Pakistan, in small runs, so we can get it right.</p><p>The name is the idea. Move at your own pace, find your own lane, and wear something that moves with you.</p>",
